<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Dec 1.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Dec 1.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain and other developing countries have much to gain from international agreements on the globalisation of trade, said a commerce ministry advisor.</p>
<p>AL AYAM</p>
<p>- A new Islamic investment bank is to be established in Bahrain with capital of $50 million.</p>
<p>- Gulf Arab states' oil income is expected to be $90 billion in 1996.</p>
</text>
